A race condition exists between write and stop requests, leading to a
null-ptr-deref in [1].

CPU0				CPU1
====				====
md_submit_bio()
md_handle_request()		do_md_stop()
raid1_make_request()		 __md_stop()
raid1_write_request()		   mddev->private = NULL
wait_barrier()
